ive rules":[52,53],"##Issue#4) How does archiver work in general and whats the behavior?#STEP 4: When the Archive Job identifies an archive rule that meets the conditions to start archiving, it will do the following:":[54,58],"##Issue#4) How does archiver work in general and whats the behavior?#STEP 4: When the Archive Job identifies an archive rule that meets the conditions to start archiving, it will do the following:#{1}":[56,56],"##Issue#4) How does archiver work in general and whats the behavior?#STEP 4: When the Archive Job identifies an archive rule that meets the conditions to start archiving, it will do the following:#{2}":[57,58],"##Issue#4) How does archiver work in general and whats the behavior?#STEP 5: It inserts logs of the archived records on the 'sys\\_archive\\_log' table":[59,60],"##Issue#5) Whats the Archive Run tab?":[61,64],"##Issue#5) Whats the Archive Run tab?#{1}":[63,64],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?":[65,79],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{1}":[67,70],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{2}":[71,71],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{3}":[72,72],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{4}":[73,73],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{5}":[74,74],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{6}":[75,75],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{7}":[76,76],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{8}":[77,77],"##Issue#6) Whats the sys\\_archive\\_log table?#{9}":[78,79],"##Issue#7) On an Archive Rule, what is the difference between having the 'Retained References' checked or unchecked?":[80,85],"##Issue#7) On an Archive Rule, what is the difference between having the 'Retained References' checked or unchecked?#{1}":[82,85],"##Issue#8) If I have been archiving records with 'Retained References' unchecked and then decide to check the 'Retained References' checkbox, will the older archived records prior to checking the 'Retained Reference