e rule also archive related records?#_To setup 3 layers down of related records:_":[113,114],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 1:  Go to the 'Archive Related Records' Tab#{2}":[115,116],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 2:  Click New ----> It will take you to the '/sys\\_archive\\_related.do' form#{2}":[117,118],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 3: Input the following information:#{2}#{1}":[121,124],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 3: Input the following information:#{2}#{2}":[125,125],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 3: Input the following information:#{2}#{3}":[126,126],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 3: Input the following information:#{2}#{4}":[127,127],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 3: Input the following information:#{2}#{5}":[128,129],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 4: Click Submit#{2}":[130,131],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 5: Create new archive rule for the same reference table used for the related records setup on parent archive rule above.":[132,133],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 6: Set the parent archive rule on the parent reference qualifier lookup on the new archive rule to make it a child archive rule.":[134,135],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#STEP 7: Repeat STEP 3 to STEP 4 for the new Child Archive Rule to setup the 3rd layer related records.":[136,137],"##Issue#9) How can we setup to have an archive rule also archive related records?#Example: Check t