at meets the conditions to start deleting it, will do the following:#{2}":[246,247],"##Issue#20) How does the archive destroy rule work in general and whats the behavior?#STEP 5: The corresponding deleted archived records referenced on the 'sys\\_archive\\_log' table will also be deleted":[248,249],"##Issue#21) How can we archive cmdb related data?":[250,253],"##Issue#21) How can we archive cmdb related data?#{1}":[252,253]},"outlinks":[{"title":"KB0680127: How to restore multiple archived records in batch mode","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0680127","line":179},{"title":"KB1271880: How to restore multiple archived records with related records in batch mode","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1271880","line":185},{"title":"KB0684703: Unable to bulk re-archive restored records","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0684703","line":207},{"title":"Create a destroy rule","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/en-US/bundle/utah-platform-administration/page/administer/database-rotation/task/t_CreateADestructionRule.html","line":227},{"title":"CMDB Data Manager","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/csh?topicname=cmdb-data-management.html&version=latest \"CMDB Data Manager\"","line":252}],"metadata":{"title":"Archiving - FAQ","aliases":["KB0547695"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0547695","kb_number":"KB0547695","last_modified":"2026-04-30"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/performance/KB0547695 - Archiving - FAQ.md"},
